+
+Review only this branch diff against main. Dependencies were reused rather than freshly installed; no excluded environment file/integration edit was copied into either source archive. Default Turbopack/fresh npm install in CI and an approved public preview remain separate checks; both comparable production builds here use the supported webpack compiler without disabling lint/type checks. Existing nested-lockfile warnings are environmental.
