+
+The last change was a text-only replacement of the networking article's blanket temperature prescription with equipment-specific requirements. The final source was rebuilt and its public HTML rechecked. Home and performance code are unchanged from the twelve timed runs; their raw timing results were not rewritten as fresh measurements after this article-only clarification.
